ame":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1050915/000105091526000006/pwr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Quanta Services, Inc. (together with its subsidiaries, \"Quanta,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\") is a leading provider of comprehensive infrastructure solutions for the electric and gas utility, power generation, large load center, manufacturing, communications, pipeline and energy industries in the United States, Canada, Australia and select other international markets. We provide design, engineering, procurement, construction, upgrade and repair and maintenance services for infrastructure within each of these industries, including electric power transmission and distribution networks; substation facilities; wind, solar and gas power generation and transmission and battery storage facilities; low voltage electrical, mechanical, plumbing and process infrastructure for large load centers, such as data center, advanced manufacturing, healthcare, pharmaceutical and industrial facilities; communication","zh":"Quanta Services, Inc.（及其子公司，統稱為「Quanta」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家領先的綜合基礎設施解決方案提供商，為美國、加拿大、澳洲和部分其他國際市場的電力和燃氣公用事業、發電、大型負載中心、製造、通訊、管道和能源行業提供綜合基礎設施解決方案。我們為每個行業的基礎設施提供設計、工程、採購、施工、升級以及維修和保養服務，包括輸電和配電網路；變電站設施；風能、太陽能和天然氣發電和輸電以及電池儲存設施；大型負載中心的低壓電氣、機械、管道和製程基礎設施，例如資料中心、先進製造、醫療保健製藥和工業設施；"},{"en":"The performance of our business generally depends on our ability to obtain contracts with customers and to effectively deliver the services provided under those contracts. Our services are typically provided pursuant to master service agreements (MSAs), repair and maintenance contracts and fixed price and non-fixed price construction and engineering contracts. We offer comprehensive and diverse solutions on a broad geographic scale and have a solid base of long-standing customer relationships in each of the industries we serve. We believe our reputation for safety leadership, responsiveness and performance, geographic reach, comprehensive service offerings and financial strength have resulted in strong relationships with numerous customers, and we endeavor to develop and maintain strategic alliances and preferred service provider status with our customers.","zh":"我們的業務績效通常取決於我們與客戶簽訂合約並有效交付根據這些合約提供的服務的能力。我們的服務通常根據主服務協議 (MSA)、維修和保養合約以及固定價格和非固定價格建設和工程合約提供。我們在廣泛的地理範圍內提供全面且多樣化的解決方案，並在我們所服務的每個行業中擁有堅實的長期客戶關係基礎。我們相信，我們在安全領導力、回應能力和績效、地理覆蓋範圍、全面的服務產品和財務實力方面的聲譽已與眾多客戶建立了牢固的關係，我們努力與客戶建立和維持戰略聯盟和首選服務提供者地位。"},{"en":"We believe that our business strategies, along with our safety culture and financial resources, differentiate us from our competition and position us to benefit from future programmatic and capital spending by our customers. Our strategies include delivering and continuing to expand our portfolio of infrastructure solutions to existing and potential customers, developing our technological and training capabilities, remaining committed to the safety of our employees, and maintaining an entrepreneurial culture throughout our organization. We believe executing on these strategies places us in the position to be a solutions provider to our customers and capitalize on opportunities and trends in the industries we serve and expand our operations to select new markets.","zh":"我們相信，我們的業務策略以及我們的安全文化和財務資源使我們在競爭中脫穎而出，並使我們能夠從客戶未來的計劃和資本支出中受益。我們的策略包括向現有和潛在客戶提供並繼續擴展我們的基礎設施解決方案組合，發展我們的技術和培訓能力，繼續致力於員工的安全，以及在整個組織中維持創業文化。我們相信，執行這些策略使我們能夠成為客戶的解決方案提供者，並利用我們所服務行業的機會和趨勢，並擴大我們的業務以選擇新市場。"}],"markets":[{"en":"During the three months ended March 31, 2025, Quanta's Chief Executive Officer reevaluated how performance of the business is assessed and how resources are allocated, which resulted in a change in the reporting of management's internal financial information. As a result, beginning with the three months ended March 31, 2025, Quanta began reporting the results of its two operating segments, which are also its two reportable segments: (1) Electric Infrastructure Solutions (Electric) and (2) Underground Utility and Infrastructure Solutions (Underground and Infrastructure). The Electric segment consists of the historical Electric Power Infrastructure Solutions and the Renewable Energy Infrastructure Solutions segments. In conjunction with this change, certain prior period amounts have been recast to conform to this new segment reporting structure.","zh":"截至2025年3月31日的三個月內，廣達執行長重新評估如何評估業務績效以及如何分配資源，這導致管理層內部財務資訊的報告發生變化。因此，從截至2025年3月31日的三個月開始，廣達開始報告其兩個營運部門的業績，這也是其兩個可報告部門：（1）電力基礎設施解決方案（電力）和（2）地下公用事業和基礎設施解決方案（地下和基礎設施）。電力部門由歷史電力基礎設施解決方案和再生能源基礎設施解決方案部門組成。與此變更結合，某些前期金額已重新調整，以符合此新的分部報告結構。"},{"en":"Our entrepreneurial business model allows multiple operating companies to serve the same or similar customers and to provide a range of services across end user markets. Reportable segment information, including revenues and operating income by type of work, is gathered from each operating company. Classification of operating company revenues by type of work for segment reporting purposes can require judgment on the part of management.","zh":"我們的創業商業模式允許多家營運公司為相同或相似的客戶提供服務，並在最終用戶市場提供一系列服務。可報告的部門資訊，包括按工作類型劃分的收入和營業收入，是從每個運營公司收集的。出於分部報告目的，按工作類型對營運公司收入進行分類可能需要管理層的判斷。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We have a large and diverse customer base, including many of the leading companies in the industries we serve, and we have developed strong strategic alliances with numerous customers and strive to develop and maintain our status as a preferred solutions provider to our customers. For the year ended December 31, 2025, our largest customer accounted for 8% of our consolidated revenues and our ten largest customers accounted for 30% of our consolidated revenues. Representative customers include:","zh":"我們擁有龐大且多元化的客戶群，包括我們所服務行業中的許多領先公司，我們與眾多客戶建立了強大的策略聯盟，並努力發展和維持我們作為客戶首選解決方案提供者的地位。截至2025年12月31日止年度，我們最大的客戶占我們合併收入的8%，我們十大客戶占我們合併收入的30%。代表性客戶包括："}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electric Power","val":23001468000,"zh":"電力"},{"name":"Underground & Infrastructure","val":5478229000,"zh":"地下及基礎設施"}],"total":28479697000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":26482963000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CA","val":1018752000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"AU","val":779532000,"zh":"非盟"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":198450000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":28479697000}},"peers":["ETN","MTZ","EME","FIX","GEV"]}}